# PayChain Merchant Dashboard - Environment Variables Example

# The base URL for the backend API
# If not provided, it defaults to https://www.paychain.co.ke
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
# Alternatively (legacy support):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000

# No Stellar-specific env vars needed — the Wallet / Inflation Shield pages
# log into a real admin-onboarded "demo merchant" (see adminController.js's
# isDemoMerchant flag) interactively, the same email+password+OTP flow any
# merchant uses, not via baked-in credentials. See MerchantAuthContext.jsx.
